description "Commander Iden Verso

^3Weapons:
- Melee
- TL-50 Imperial Repeater (3)
-- 15% Faster RoF
-- 10% Less Damage
-- 25% Faster Velocity
-- 9 Blobs
- Pulse Cannon (2)
-- Disruptor
-- 25% More Damage
-- 25% Faster RoF
- RK-3 Pistol (3)
- Pulse Grenade (2)
- Survival Knife (Cyan Style Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Defense
-- No Deflect
-- Cripples/Poisons On Hit

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
- Ammo (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- 25% Faster Hacking 
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Environmential Protection (1)
- Knockdown Roll

^8Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS1]
- Defensive Seeker ^3[CS2]
- Personal Shield ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook ^3[CS4]
-- Slips and Pulses And Knockbacks"
